# Build context for infra/Dockerfile.api and infra/Dockerfile.web (deployment.md section 3).
# Nothing secret, nothing that is not needed to build.

# Secrets and local configuration (only .env.example would be harmless, and no image needs it)
.env
.env.*

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.output
**/.vinxi
**/.tanstack
**/coverage

# Not in the image (SEC-34): specs, docs, tests, tooling, local notes
.git
.claude
.specify
.vitest
**/.vitest
specs
docs
spike
.vscode
.idea
**/test
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
playwright-report
test-results
**/*.log
.DS_Store

# Infrastructure code and state never enter an image
infra/terraform
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars
